WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.340
Nina's week. How often does she do things?

2
00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:07.948
Hi! I'm Nina. I always get up early, at six.

3
00:00:08.398 --> 00:00:10.581
Then I get dressed and I have breakfast.

4
00:00:12.831 --> 00:00:16.314
I go for a walk every other day, in the park near my house.

5
00:00:16.764 --> 00:00:18.528
It's my favorite time of the day!

6
00:00:20.778 --> 00:00:23.890
I go to the supermarket once a week, on Saturdays.

7
00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:25.826
I usually go in the morning.

8
00:00:28.076 --> 00:00:30.026
I hardly ever go to a restaurant.

9
00:00:30.476 --> 00:00:33.077
I usually have dinner at home. I love to cook!

10
00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:40.250
And I love the beach! I go to the beach twice a month, on Sundays.

11
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:42.325
I always have a good time there.

12
00:00:44.575 --> 00:00:47.408
And you? How often do you go to the beach?

